Review satisfied clients and partner open loops. Ask the owner in Slack who should ask for referrals. Prepare consent-backed proof-page updates with verified sources and attribution. Load the chief-sales-officer skill and private integration contract. Preserve campaign holds and source freshness. No external execution without applicable authorization. Keep the Slack report under 250 words: source coverage, top three revenue risks or actions, owners and due times, missing decisions, next checkpoint. No internal file paths, table counts or installation traces. Disconnected sources mean unknown activity, not no activity. Existing authorization persists; ask only for missing identifiers or decisions.
